# One in-run fix, recorded rather than hidden:
#   scripts/source_probe.py initially passed multi_class="multinomial" to LogisticRegression,
#   which scikit-learn 1.9.0 has removed. The argument was dropped; multinomial is the
#   default for a multi-class target in that version, so the intended behaviour is unchanged.
# One test expectation corrected:
#   the new batch test first asserted that a missing file yields status ERROR. The pipeline
#   actually returns REJECTED at stage "decode" with reason "unreadable: FileNotFoundError",
#   which is the better contract. The test was corrected to pin that, including the assertion
#   that it is distinguishable from an OOD rejection.
